WEBVTT

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:26.370
The darkness is
covering the sky.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:31.810
What's that?

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:35.290
Has the gateway
finally been destroyed?

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:37.290
Soon Darkstar's
true form will come.

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:42.920
And thus twilight
falls across this world.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:49.590
Valgaav... Where?
Where are you going now?

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:12.350
Even if I used the Giga
Slave to take out Valgaav...

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:16.060
...if Darkstar's completely released,
I'll have nothing left for him!

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:20.100
You mean...

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:21.530
There's no way out of this.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:23.670
Valgaav...

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.740
Miss Lina!
Let's get after Valgaav!

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.100
How?! We'll never
catch up with him!

00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:32.570
And what?! Gonna have us ride
on your back and fly us again?!

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:37.540
Even with my wings, I could
never catch up with him.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:42.550
But... But I know
where he's going!

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:48.450
I'll use the last of my power
to transport us all out there.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:50.050
Miss Filia...

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:50.890
Can you do that?

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.860
Yes! I'll try!

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:38.110
Damn him... He's already
begun devouring this world!

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:40.150
All right, let's go.

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:42.910
Filia, I'm sorry about before.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.010
It's all right, Miss Lina.

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:47.480
We're coming as well.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:48.250
Sirius?

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:52.720
The five Darkstar weapons are
stabilized when within the same field.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.050
It increases their effect.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:57.720
An alliance of Gods,
Monsters, and Humans, eh?

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:01.000
All right! But you take
orders from me. Got that?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.430
Fine with me.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:10.540
Hey! Don't leave me behind!

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:00.490
Filia!

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:02.920
This is...

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.520
The temple of
the Ancient Dragons.

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:09.130
Look!

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:16.200
Here he comes!

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:18.040
So, here's where the
showdown will happen.

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:20.970
Okay, concentrate all
five weapons on one point.

00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:21.980
Attack in waves!

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:23.250
Right!

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:38.990
He's getting closer.

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:42.830
We won't fire till the last
second to maximize the damage.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:46.390
If worse comes to worst,
I'll cast the Giga Slave!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.380
Closer now!

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:55.340
Now!

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:56.280
Light, come forth!

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:07.880
Second wave!

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:26.200
It's working... It's working!

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:28.140
IT'S WORKI NG!!!

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:30.180
We're beating him?

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.150
We're really
beating Darkstar?!

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.710
Third wave!
Attack as I cast my spell!

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:36.960
The Giga Slave?!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:37.920
Miss Lina!

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:43.420
"Lord of Darkness of the Four
Worlds, on thy bonds I do swear."

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:48.360
"Grant me all the power
that you possess!"

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:52.270
The amplification
spell won't activate?!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.230
The talismans
have been sealed!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.580
Shoot first!

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:31.840
Valgaav...

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:45.450
To whom will you pray?
The Gods? The Monsters?

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:50.390
I don't know. I don't...

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:53.560
I don't know what
else I can say to you!

00:08:57.170 --> 00:08:58.260
Filia!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.830
Darkstar!

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.800
DAMN YOU TO HELL!

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:14.120
To break the endless cycle
of your eternal competition...

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:17.490
To erase the limitless cycle
of your eternal struggle...

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:23.020
...the Gods and the Monsters
must both be destroyed.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.030
Erulogos!

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:34.900
Gods and Monsters!
Now know the depths of despair!

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:41.600
He's wrong...

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.480
Neither the Gods nor the
Monsters feel despair. It's!

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:46.820
Here he comes again!

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:47.910
Use this!

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:49.180
Me?!

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:53.420
What'll we do? Got a plan?

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:57.290
"There shall come a controller of a dark
star who shall call forth the light."

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.190
"And the world shall be
flooded with darkness."

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:00.830
The Fire Dragon
King's prophecy?

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:05.470
The "dark star" has definitely
flooded the world with darkness!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.340
"Dragon's blood shall spread..."

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:10.340
"...and following the power
between light and darkness..."

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:12.240
"...a single star
shall be awakened."

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:15.500
A power between light and
darkness, namely humans...

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.810
...shall call back Galvayra,
the final weapon.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.510
Then the rest of it must be...

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:20.240
Right!

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:21.410
Chaos words!

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:23.650
The five lights spinning
around the star...

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.380
...are the five Darkstar weapons!

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:28.330
The power that is a darkness beyond
twilight is the power of the Monsters!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.630
And the brilliance beyond the
dawn is the power of the Gods!

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:35.290
And the one to
control that power is...

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.130
...a human.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.180
Dammit! He's coming closer!

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.220
We've gotta act now!

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.450
I'm not really that
good with weapons...

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:03.850
This is no time
to be saying that!

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:10.830
We combine holy
and demonic power...

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:13.300
...and then transfer that
into the five weapons.

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:15.030
It may be possible.

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:17.300
If I and Filia draw upon
Lord Ruby-Eye's power...

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:19.240
...and Ceiphied's
power respectively...

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:22.510
But to activate the
power of the chaos words...

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:25.170
...would take someone
of enormous capacity.

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:28.240
Now I see why Miss Luna
chose you, Miss Lina.

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:31.620
I'll summon
Lord Ruby-Eye's power.

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.520
As for Ceiphied's power...

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:35.610
Only Filia, a servant
of the Gods, can do that.

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:37.160
I have to?

00:12:06.420 --> 00:12:08.480
Everyone, listen! We're
gonna try the final option!

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:10.720
What final option?

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.190
Get in a circle around me!

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:14.960
When I give the word,
attack! Move it!

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:15.690
Right!

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:19.630
Soon that segment of Darkstar
will rejoin the main body...

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.930
...and he will be fully
materialized in this world!

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:23.030
Gotcha!

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:23.900
Miss Lina!

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:27.600
If we don't do this,
it's the end of the world!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:31.540
Destruction by Darkstar!
Or purification by Valgaav!

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:33.100
No, you're wrong...

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:41.720
He doesn't want destruction
or purification!

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.870
Filia, call on the
Gods' power! Hurry!

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:03.840
I can't.

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:04.670
Filia?!

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.140
How can I do that?!

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:10.180
After what my people did
to the Ancient Dragons...

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:12.550
...if I kill Valgaav, then!

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:15.320
Filia! This is no time
to be talking like that!

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:18.250
I can't do it.
I can't. I can't...

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:20.690
Filia! Make up
your mind! Filia!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:25.870
He's got more?!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:29.500
If he attacks us now,
we're finished!

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:30.230
Lina!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:35.740
Filia! If you won't kill Valgaav,
save the world, or do something...

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:37.940
...you may as well
lie down and die!

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:41.240
But that isn't going
to make anything RIGHT!

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:47.310
Maybe she's right.
Up until now, I've just...

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:50.590
I've just stood by watching.

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:54.320
I haven't done anything.

00:13:55.830 --> 00:14:00.290
Nothing... Nothing. Nothing!

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.700
FI LIA!

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.670
Miss Lina, I'll do it!

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:08.640
Filia!

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:12.040
Made up your mind?

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:14.550
I have nothing to say
to a Monster like you!

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:16.410
That's the Filia I know!

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:21.780
LI NA! You ready yet?!

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:34.460
Here goes nothing...

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:36.440
The one who controls the
power of light and darkness...

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:38.330
...is the human who
exists between them!

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:48.970
Fires of purification
within my wings...

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:52.580
Smash everything to dust.

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:55.980
Valgaav...

00:14:56.060 --> 00:15:00.550
The world you want isn't
created after destruction.

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:05.190
We build it everyday,
step by step...

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:06.830
Here we go! Guys?

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:08.060
- Yeah!
- Ready!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.270
Finally!

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.200
"Born of the
Lord of Darkness..."

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:14.170
"Five lights which
spin around the star!"

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:19.570
"Let the power of the
darkness beyond twilight..."

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:22.310
"...and the brilliance
beyond the dawn..."

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.440
"...that we have called
here be joined together!"

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:27.110
"I now let loose
a single arrow..."

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:31.020
"...that will split
the heavens apart!"

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:57.810
We failed?!

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:01.620
No! The chaos force created
by the Light-Dark Fusion...

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:04.210
...is transforming from
nothingness into creation.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:05.760
We should see
incredible power soon!

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:26.840
At last, I die...

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.510
It all returns to white...

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:12.960
Lord Valgaav!

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:17.290
Boss! Say it's not true!

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:20.890
It's not true! IT'S NOT TRUE!

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:28.670
Maybe, in the end, it was
Valgaav who most wanted...

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:34.040
...to be freed of the
endless cycle of fate.

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:38.180
Miss Filia...

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:41.080
After so long, we finally won.

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:46.090
So why does this
victory taste so bitter?

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:47.130
Yeah, I know.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.430
At any rate,
mission accomplished.

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:25.130
Filia?

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:38.280
Valgaav...

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:44.680
This isn't an ending.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:49.460
This is your beginning...

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:09.670
Well, good luck when you
get back to your world.

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:13.110
Now, Gourry, you're SURE you want to
give the Sword of Light to Sirius?

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:14.840
It's your family
treasure, right?

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:17.640
True, but it originally
came from the other world!

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:18.620
Oh, right.

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:21.880
We raised
ourselves up so high...

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:24.890
...that we forgot
who we really were.

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:29.660
Farewell, you of
Ceiphied's world.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:37.160
Filia...

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:41.330
You can pay what you owe
me next time we meet.

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:42.880
Well, time to go!

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:46.840
Take care.

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:01.790
All right, then!

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:05.290
Let's go home, guys!
